ial annotations. Tier 1\n(`disallow_untyped_defs`) now covers 13 packages and tier 2 (`disallow_any_explicit`)\ncovers `rebar._cli.*` and `rebar._snapshot.*`.\n\n## The residue (measured on main @ ea6ee67e6a)\n| package | untyped defs | explicit Any |\n|---|---|---|\n| llm | 293 | ~165 |\n| _commands | 146 | large |\n| _engine | 134 | ~224 |\n\nThis is epic-sized and NOT trivially small, which is why it was excluded rather than\nattempted. It also collides with near-cap modules (`llm/plan_review/pass1.py` is at the\n800 LOC cap) and with the reconciler port-boundary work already scoped by\ncc77-8120-bcc6-47e8.\n\n## Approach\nNeeds decomposition. Prioritise by DRIVER (contract boundaries first), not by count, and\npromote a package into tier 1 then tier 2 only when `mypy src/rebar/<pkg>` is clean under\nthe respective flags. Do NOT reach for `cast()` — it hides the same blindness the tiers\nexist to remove.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"003c-2dd2-203a-4725","ticket_type":"task","title":"Promote llm, _commands and _engine into the mypy strictness ratchet (573 untyped defs, ~390 explicit Any)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6e890daa-2e05-4f38-a4fa-ef1065b73fac","4f2e3833-991f-45e8-b61a-d2b4adb0a428"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786666590595358394,"uuid":"34d545de-6c8a-4817-be3c-acaaa275f55f"}